cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "JLaw-CiteGraph: An open citation graph of Japanese statutory law"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Park"
    given-names: "Yabooung"
    alias: "yabooung"
    email: "horusr8@gmail.com"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible citation graph of Japanese national statutory law, built
  deterministically from official e-Gov law XML: 8,980 laws and 1,212,708 resolved
  article-level external citation edges (722,426 cross-law; 55,651 distinct law-to-law
  pairs), with a deterministic rule-based resolver. Snapshot: e-Gov 2026-06-23.
keywords:
  - Japanese law
  - legal NLP
  - citation graph
  - knowledge graph
  - statute
  - e-Gov
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: "https://github.com/yabooung/jp-law-citation-graph/blob/main/LICENSE"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-23"
url: "https://github.com/yabooung/jp-law-citation-graph"
